Data Extraction Pipeline scripts: 

 

1_compile_mortality_sources.R: This script compiles all of the mortality data with and without GPS ] into csvs. 

2_reextraction_data_compile.R: This script cleans and compiles the re extracted data that was missing the interview year variable and geomatches the data to GPS information, saving to a parquet file. 

3_compile_and_merge_GPS_sources.R: This script filters the mortality extractions and matches the GPS information to the data, both through the geocodebook function and GPS merge code, then binds all information, included the reextractions, into a final dataset. Saving to a parquet file. 


